{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 49,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Nebuchadnezzar’s Dream"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now in the second year of Nebuchadnezzar’s reign, Nebuchadnezzar had dreams; and his spirit was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "so"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " troubled that his sleep left him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the king gave the command to call the magicians, the astrologers, the sorcerers, and the Chaldeans to tell the king his dreams. So they came and stood before the king. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the king said to them, “I have had a dream, and my spirit is anxious to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or understand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "know the dream.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Chaldeans spoke to the king in Aramaic, “O"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The original language of Daniel 2:4b through 7:28 is Aramaic."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " king, live forever! Tell your servants the dream, and we will give the interpretation.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The king answered and said to the Chaldeans, “My "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The command"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "decision is firm: if you do not make known the dream to me, and its interpretation, you shall be cut in pieces, and your houses shall be made an ash heap. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "However, if you tell the dream and its interpretation, you shall receive from me gifts, rewards, and great honor. Therefore tell me the dream and its interpretation.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They answered again and said, “Let the king tell his servants the dream, and we will give its interpretation.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The king answered and said, “I know for certain that you would gain time, because you see that my decision is firm: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "if you do not make known the dream to me, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there is only"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " one decree for you! For you have agreed to speak lying and corrupt words before me till the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Situation"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "time has changed. Therefore tell me the dream, and I shall know that you can "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or declare to me"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "give me its interpretation.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The Chaldeans answered the king, and said, “There is not a man on earth who can tell the king’s matter; therefore no king, lord, or ruler has "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "ever"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " asked such things of any magician, astrologer, or Chaldean. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "It is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or rare"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "difficult thing that the king requests, and there is no other who can tell it to the king except the gods, whose dwelling is not with flesh.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this reason the king was angry and very furious, and gave the command to destroy all the wise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Babylon. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the decree went out, and they began killing the wise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and they sought Daniel and his companions, to kill "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "God Reveals Nebuchadnezzar’s Dream"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then with counsel and wisdom Daniel answered Arioch, the captain of the king’s guard, who had gone out to kill the wise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Babylon; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "he answered and said to Arioch the king’s captain, “Why is the decree from the king so "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or harsh"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "urgent?” Then Arioch made the decision known to Daniel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Daniel went in and asked the king to give him time, that he might tell the king the interpretation. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Daniel went to his house, and made the decision known to Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah, his companions, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that they might seek mercies from the God of heaven concerning this secret, so that Daniel and his companions might not perish with the rest of the wise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Babylon. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the secret was revealed to Daniel in a night vision. So Daniel blessed the God of heaven."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Daniel answered and said:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Blessed be the name of God forever and ever,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For wisdom and might are His."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He changes the times and the seasons;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He removes kings and raises up kings;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He gives wisdom to the wise"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And knowledge to those who have understanding."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He reveals deep and secret things;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He knows what "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the darkness,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And light dwells with Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“I thank You and praise You,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "O God of my fathers;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You have given me wisdom and might,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And have now made known to me what we asked of You,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For You have made known to us the king’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. word"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "demand.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Daniel Explains the Dream"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore Daniel went to Arioch, whom the king had appointed to destroy the wise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Babylon. He went and said thus to him: “Do not destroy the wise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Babylon; take me before the king, and I will tell the king the interpretation.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Arioch quickly brought Daniel before the king, and said thus to him, “I have found a man of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. sons of the captivity"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "captives of Judah, who will make known to the king the interpretation.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The king answered and said to Daniel, whose name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Belteshazzar, “Are you able to make known to me the dream which I have seen, and its interpretation?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Daniel answered in the presence of the king, and said, “The secret which the king has demanded, the wise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the astrologers, the magicians, and the soothsayers cannot declare to the king. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But there is a God in heaven who reveals secrets, and He has made known to King Nebuchadnezzar what will be in the latter days. Your dream, and the visions of your head upon your bed, were these: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As for you, O king, thoughts came "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "mind while"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on your bed, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "about"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " what would come to pass after this; and He who reveals secrets has made known to you what will be. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But as for me, this secret has not been revealed to me because I have more wisdom than anyone living, but for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "our"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sakes who make known the interpretation to the king, and that you may "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Understand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "know the thoughts of your heart."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“You, O king, were watching; and behold, a great image! This great image, whose splendor "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " excellent, stood before you; and its form "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " awesome. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This image’s head "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of fine gold, its chest and arms of silver, its belly and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or sides"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "thighs of bronze, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "its legs of iron, its feet partly of iron and partly of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or baked clay, also vv. 34, 35, 42"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "clay. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You watched while a stone was cut out without hands, which struck the image on its feet of iron and clay, and broke them in pieces. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the iron, the clay, the bronze, the silver, and the gold were crushed together, and became like chaff from the summer threshing floors; the wind carried them away so that no trace of them was found. And the stone that struck the image became a great mountain and filled the whole earth."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the dream. Now we will tell the interpretation of it before the king. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You, O king, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a king of kings. For the God of heaven has given you a kingdom, power, strength, and glory; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and wherever the children of men dwell, or the beasts of the field and the birds of the heaven, He has given "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " into your hand, and has made you ruler over them all—you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " this head of gold. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But after you shall arise another kingdom inferior to yours; then another, a third kingdom of bronze, which shall rule over all the earth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the fourth kingdom shall be as strong as iron, inasmuch as iron breaks in pieces and shatters everything; and like iron that crushes, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that kingdom"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " will break in pieces and crush all the others. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Whereas you saw the feet and toes, partly of potter’s clay and partly of iron, the kingdom shall be divided; yet the strength of the iron shall be in it, just as you saw the iron mixed with ceramic clay. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the toes of the feet "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " partly of iron and partly of clay, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "so"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the kingdom shall be partly strong and partly "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or brittle"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fragile. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
